## Interface: 120100
## Title: MoxieTracker
## Notes: Displays current character Artisan Moxie, Shard of Dundun, Unalloyed Abundance, and Fused Vitality in a movable window.
## Author: Tharavol
## Version: @project-version@
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Coin_02
## Category: Professions
## SavedVariables: MoxieTrackerDB

## X-ReleaseNotes: Shows the current character's Artisan Moxie, Shard of Dundun, Unalloyed Abundance and Fused Vitality in a compact panel docked to the top-right of the crafting window, appearing automatically when that window opens and hiding again when it closes. Moxie is tracked for all eleven professions, and rows appear only for the professions the character actually has; Shard of Dundun, Unalloyed Abundance and Fused Vitality always show even at zero. Currencies are matched by ID rather than by name, so the addon works on any client locale, and Fused Vitality is counted across bags, bank and reagent bank. Each count is coloured against its own thresholds - Shard of Dundun green at 6 and red at 7-8, Unalloyed Abundance green at 800 or more, Moxie green at 600 or more, Fused Vitality green at 20 or more, yellow otherwise - and hovering a line shows the same tooltip as the default currency UI. Any row can be hidden from the options panel, the panel can be dragged anywhere and remembers one position for the whole account, and /moxie pin keeps it on screen regardless of the crafting window. Configure under Options > AddOns > MoxieTracker or with /moxie options (alias /moxietracker). Source, issues and release notes: https://github.com/Tharavol/MoxieTracker

